      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MISTER MANFREDI (1) broke from a low draw and filled a minor placing last start, beaten only a neck (30.14) behind Surf's Up at Sandown. Can measure up this time. REV OBERON (2) was below best last time but three back was a Rank Limit - Restricted Win winner in the quickest time on the card at Shepparton over 450m in a Rank Limit - Restricted Win. Can hit the frame this time. BUN QUAKE (5) failed to feature last start after being shuffled back early at this track, but prior to that won by 2.25 lengths at this track (30.49) beating Zipping Tyra in a Grade 5 on October 7. Has the ability to give this a shake. CORDOVA (7) is new here but can play a major role.",
